    "title": "Zenon P2P Observer",
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "description": "Read-only collection API. See api.md for row fields and interpretation. No association analysis, reviewed assertions or 90-day aggregates. GET/HEAD/OPTIONS only; bodies rejected. Raw windows at most 24 hours within 1\u20137 day retention. 1 MiB response limit. Collections cache 30 seconds with ETags; status and health use no-store."
